2. Database Per Service Pattern
====================================================================
Each service owns its database.

Risk Service
      |
   Risk DB

Control Service
      |
  Control DB

Audit Service
      |
  Audit DB

====================================================================


Why?

Avoid tight coupling.

Benefit
Independent Deployment
Independent Scaling
No Shared Schema
