3. Event-Driven Architecture
====================================================================


Most important pattern used.



Risk Created
      |
      v
risk-topic
      |
      +---- Compliance Service
      |
      +---- Audit Service
      |
      +---- Notification Service

====================================================================


Producer:

kafkaTemplate.send(
